+# Direct explicit SkillService source-region gate — local follow-up
+
+Read public map PR285 d4d04e298b6debe8e4eee5a22de9176ed2e97740 scripts/world.gd::current523_source_spell_cast_reason(record)->String. The exact callback resolves admitted current source profile, binding/row hash and active source-cell declarations in the MAP owner. Empty permits existing owner processing; nonempty rejects the explicit request. This bridge copies no map row, SpellClass mapping or definition parser and grants no Land admission.
+
+The actual newly covered path is SkillService.ready -> _source_region_cast_reason -> world.current523_source_spell_cast_reason. Direct SkillService.cast already calls ready before its toggle/local-runtime branches, material spend, cooldown and effect queueing, so it receives the same gate without a second effect/payment path. A non-string callback result is held. Main's existing ready/cast dispatch may also recheck the same READ-ONLY callback; no permission is cached between changing cells, and no cost/effect is run twice. This is not a claim that every game skill entrypoint is covered.
+
+When the map callback is absent, ordinary host behavior remains. An actually active source session with an already bound source profile is held until its source-region owner exists; no ID is fabricated from a local skill. Unbound legacy/local behavior stays unchanged. When the callback is present it alone owns the generic/non-generic source-field distinction and exact declaration scope.
+
+This gate is ONLY at explicit ready/cast requests. It does not remove active buffs, re-gate already launched impacts, interpret passive/NPC/proc/child-stage behavior, expand NoSpellToOther, release an entry restriction or touch map/population files. The map's LandAttributeType164/Unit12 meaning is not reimplemented here. Existing ownership, costs, saves and frozen distribution stay unchanged.
+
+This candidate and its area receiver are separate from both frozen f71 twelve-file and fe908 three-file candidates. No publication/merge/phone update or game/tests/compilation/render/CI was run. Original assets, packs, source bank, saves and excluded work remain preserved.
